1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,880
New hires learn on real customers, and one wrong promise can cost a company dearly.

2
00:00:07,584 --> 00:00:11,401
SkillCoach turns a company's own knowledge into realistic practice

3
00:00:11,401 --> 00:00:14,234
conversations, powered by Gemini on Google Cloud.

4
00:00:14,234 --> 00:00:17,704
Trainees sign in with Firebase, or simply try it as a guest.

5
00:00:18,321 --> 00:00:21,721
An admin uploads product brochures and policies.

6
00:00:23,652 --> 00:00:29,092
Gemini 4 reads those documents and proposes realistic customer types.

7
00:00:31,969 --> 00:00:37,009
Every objection and hidden need links back to the passage it came from.

8
00:00:37,638 --> 00:00:40,196
A trainer checks the sources and approves.

9
00:00:40,196 --> 00:00:42,998
Only approved customers are used for practice.

10
00:00:47,347 --> 00:00:49,885
Now a new insurance advisor meets Mr.

11
00:00:49,885 --> 00:00:52,698
Tan, a cautious retiree, on a video call.

12
00:00:52,698 --> 00:00:56,197
He is a lifelike customer made with Gemini and Veo.

13
00:00:56,197 --> 00:00:58,187
His first question is a trap.

14
00:01:09,573 --> 00:01:11,318
Here's the costly mistake:

15
00:01:11,318 --> 00:01:13,330
promising a guaranteed return.

16
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:18,698
Before it reaches the customer, the Compliance Guard stops it, quotes the words,

17
00:01:18,698 --> 00:01:19,973
and names the rule.

18
00:01:20,325 --> 00:01:22,513
Send it anyway, and trust drops.

19
00:01:22,513 --> 00:01:24,565
The coach suggests a way back.

20
00:01:31,696 --> 00:01:33,320
An honest answer works better.

21
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:38,136
The customer only states facts from the company's documents, with sources on every reply.

22
00:02:02,317 --> 00:02:03,586
Turn on a live call.

23
00:02:03,586 --> 00:02:08,157
The trainee's camera joins with a virtual background, and on-device face

24
00:02:08,157 --> 00:02:10,822
tracking reads expression and eye contact.

25
00:02:10,822 --> 00:02:12,917
Gemini then coaches the delivery.

26
00:02:33,215 --> 00:02:36,252
Each turn runs a pipeline of Gemini agents:

27
00:02:36,252 --> 00:02:41,055
compliance judge, customer, grounding check, trust model, and coach.

28
00:02:58,474 --> 00:03:00,554
Now, the report.

29
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:08,397
One forbidden promise fails the session, however good the rest was.

30
00:03:08,397 --> 00:03:10,840
The overall score cannot go above fifty-nine.

31
00:03:11,191 --> 00:03:17,005
Every score quotes the trainee's own words, verified against the transcript.

32
00:03:17,005 --> 00:03:19,071
No evidence, no high score.

33
00:03:22,164 --> 00:03:25,494
Managers see aggregates, never transcripts:

34
00:03:25,494 --> 00:03:29,676
skill gaps, broken rules, and who is ready to go live.

35
00:03:29,676 --> 00:03:31,844
Sample team data is labeled.

36
00:03:33,914 --> 00:03:34,863
Under the hood:

37
00:03:34,863 --> 00:03:39,608
Firebase Hosting and Authentication, Cloud Run, Firestore, Gemini 4 for the

38
00:03:39,608 --> 00:03:43,594
customer, coach and report, and Veo for the lifelike customers.

39
00:03:45,194 --> 00:03:45,968
SkillCoach.

40
00:03:45,968 --> 00:03:48,994
Practice the conversation before it counts.
